# UI HUD

- Use design tokens (`--text`, `--muted`, `--input-bg`) and shared primitives (`FieldInput`, `NeoButton`, `Panel`)
- Form controls must set explicit text color (no black-on-black)
- Match existing HUD patterns; do not invent a second design system
- Prefer `FieldInput` / `tf-field` for inputs so Tailwind instance utilities can override defaults
